{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_2f73e3534f4d034ea74a842c21d192a3cf37611f8178ba13f00d613de01ff20c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Paseo exposes a CLI with commands like `paseo run --provider`, `paseo ls`, `paseo attach`, and `paseo send` for launching and interacting with agents from the terminal."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4266081afd5994302ccb482d77ac5360b01263cbbb2837e39a5d2a87987bdc0f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Plugins run with access to the daemon machine and connected clients, so users are warned to install only code they trust."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5ccbe47424035d9d64d35fded32cec0662a3b007defd5b728d24a679c4480d97"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI can target a remote daemon with `--host`, where `--cwd` is interpreted as a path on that host."},{"claim_ids":["clm_66a42e99517dd335fb6d8a39cdd4f7b3874a3659a9f51ccffecf9ad3b8677f14"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Paseo is self-hosted: agents run on the user's own machine with their existing dev environment, tools, configs, and skills."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6b701738db42bec296373cb7b0ab3c02bdf18a8fa259d260498b10a4358e02e6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The daemon supports a plugin system: TypeScript plugins adding themes, panels, commands, settings screens, and providers, installed via `paseo plugin add <source>` from a local directory or Git repo."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9863cfd26a467fda82c4be1692baa297cbbfc4b1d2d687a3b1a956b577ca97ad"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The monorepo includes packages/server (daemon with agent orchestration, WebSocket API, MCP server), packages/app (Expo client), packages/cli, packages/desktop (Electron), packages/relay, and packages/website."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a84d860c2cac79f2946f6e52b58fc3557c40546367a737cb01469930a65c3d68"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Paseo requires at least one external agent CLI (Claude Code, Codex, GitHub Copilot, OpenCode, or Pi) installed and configured with credentials."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b7d0ba4811f8358ebb573999b823f55d887046a8bf107e752c12962c5c0fb96a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A TypeScript SDK package `@getpaseo/client` connects over WebSocket (e.g. ws://127.0.0.1:6767/ws) and lets code create agents with a provider, cwd, and prompt, then await their result."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c69eea4ce00cf55055f8c61303a45d7386ac62373f342711e500d89e89a0a926"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Paseo ships skills installable via `npx skills add getpaseo/paseo`, including /paseo-handoff, /paseo-advisor, and /paseo-committee for agent-to-agent delegation and review patterns."},{"claim_ids":["clm_df8297d21f6e72e24420ed12e4df86bf1f31b26078d5dbc39c99cb0682027512"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A local daemon manages the coding agents, and clients (desktop, mobile, web, CLI) connect to it; agents can also run in parallel on the user's machines."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fffa944e55dfe362466200e6a7bbb1db41fb64b225659644cd48a53718565b9a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README states Paseo has no telemetry, tracking, or forced log-ins, describing a privacy-first stance."}],"claim_ids":["clm_2f73e3534f4d034ea74a842c21d192a3cf37611f8178ba13f00d613de01ff20c","clm_4266081afd5994302ccb482d77ac5360b01263cbbb2837e39a5d2a87987bdc0f","clm_5ccbe47424035d9d64d35fded32cec0662a3b007defd5b728d24a679c4480d97","clm_66a42e99517dd335fb6d8a39cdd4f7b3874a3659a9f51ccffecf9ad3b8677f14","clm_6b701738db42bec296373cb7b0ab3c02bdf18a8fa259d260498b10a4358e02e6","clm_9863cfd26a467fda82c4be1692baa297cbbfc4b1d2d687a3b1a956b577ca97ad","clm_a84d860c2cac79f2946f6e52b58fc3557c40546367a737cb01469930a65c3d68","clm_b7d0ba4811f8358ebb573999b823f55d887046a8bf107e752c12962c5c0fb96a","clm_c69eea4ce00cf55055f8c61303a45d7386ac62373f342711e500d89e89a0a926","clm_df8297d21f6e72e24420ed12e4df86bf1f31b26078d5dbc39c99cb0682027512","clm_fffa944e55dfe362466200e6a7bbb1db41fb64b225659644cd48a53718565b9a"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:51:08Z","created_by_operation":"op_bf679629b4c44e6593d0a01dbe5bb2fa","id":"pg_1dff3fe7641254a086577c6520b73407","